Bank Account Management System
Project Description
This is a simple Bank Account Management System developed in Python. It is a console-based application that allows users to perform basic banking operations through a menu-driven interface.
Features
Create a new bank account
Deposit money
Withdraw money
Check account balance
View account details
Exit the program
Technologies Used
Python 3
How to Run the Project
Download or clone this repository.
Open the project in a Python IDE such as Pydroid 3, VS Code, or IDLE.
Run the Python file.
Follow the on-screen menu to perform banking operations.
Sample Menu
Create Account
Deposit Money
Withdraw Money
Check Balance
View Account Details
Exit
